###############################################################################
# KỊCH BẢN 3: Đặt Lịch Bằng Gói Đã Mua (Miễn phí)
# Mục tiêu: User có "Gói 10 lần/tháng" đặt lịch MIỄN PHÍ (không thanh toán)
###############################################################################

# ===========================
# 🔧 CONFIGURATION
# ===========================
@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@apiVersion = v1

# Auth tokens (replace with real tokens from login)
@userToken = YOUR_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@staffToken = YOUR_STAFF_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

# Entity IDs (replace with real IDs from database)
@userId = YOUR_USER_ID_HERE
@stationId = YOUR_STATION_ID_HERE
@batteryModelId = YOUR_BATTERY_MODEL_ID_HERE
@vehicleId = YOUR_VEHICLE_ID_HERE
@subscriptionPlanId = YOUR_SUBSCRIPTION_PLAN_ID_HERE

# Test data
@slotDate = 2025-10-25
@slotStartTime = 09:00:00
@slotEndTime = 10:00:00

###############################################################################
# 📚 PREREQUISITES: Setup Subscription
# Trước khi test LUỒNG 3, user PHẢI có subscription active
###############################################################################

### STEP 0A: Check user's current subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/subscriptions/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### STEP 0B: Create subscription if needed (via Payment flow - LUỒNG 1)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/payments/create-subscription
# See existing subscription creation flow

### STEP 0C: Verify subscription details
# Expected response from STEP 0A:
# {
#   "id": "...",
#   "subscriptionPlanId": "...",
#   "isActive": true,
#   "currentMonthSwapCount": 2,  // Đã dùng 2 lần
#   "subscriptionPlan": {
#     "name": "Gói 10 lần/tháng",
#     "maxSwapsPerMonth": 10
#   }
# }

###############################################################################
# 🎯 LUỒNG 3: USER ĐẶT LỊCH BẰNG GÓI (MIỄN PHÍ)
# Flow: Frontend → POST /api/v1/slot-reservations → Backend validate subscription → Create Reservation (NO Payment)
###############################################################################

### ✅ BƯỚC 1: User đặt lịch (Frontend gọi API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}",
  "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}",
  "slotDate": "{{slotDate}}",
  "slotStartTime": "{{slotStartTime}}",
  "slotEndTime": "{{slotEndTime}}"
}

# Expected Response (201 Created):
# {
#   "id": "new-reservation-id",
#   "userId": "...",
#   "stationId": "...",
#   "batteryModelId": "...",
#   "slotDate": "2025-10-25",
#   "slotStartTime": "09:00:00",
#   "slotEndTime": "10:00:00",
#   "status": 0,  // Pending
#   "qrCode": "EVB_RES_20251023_XYZ123",
#   "createdAt": "2025-10-23T10:30:00Z",
#   "batteryUnitId": null,
#   "checkedInAt": null,
#   "verifiedByStaffId": null
# }

### 🔍 VERIFY: Check reservation created (no payment record)
# Query database to verify:
# 1. Reservation exists with Status=Pending
# 2. NO Payment record linked to this reservation
# 3. User's subscription CurrentMonthSwapCount NOT incremented yet (increments at check-in)

###############################################################################
# Database Verification Queries (run in SQL Server Management Studio)
###############################################################################

# -- Check created reservation
# SELECT TOP 1 * FROM Reservations
# WHERE UserId = '{{userId}}'
# ORDER BY CreatedAt DESC;
#
# Expected: 1 row with Status=0 (Pending), QRCode generated
#
# -- Check NO payment record
# SELECT * FROM Payments
# WHERE ReservationId = 'new-reservation-id-from-above';
#
# Expected: 0 rows (no payment for subscription booking)
#
# -- Check user's subscription counter (not incremented yet)
# SELECT * FROM UserSubscriptions
# WHERE UserId = '{{userId}}' AND IsActive = 1;
#
# Expected: CurrentMonthSwapCount unchanged (increments at check-in, not booking)

###############################################################################
# 🎉 BƯỚC 2: User đến trạm → Staff check-in
# Note: Check-in flow là CHUNG cho cả LUỒNG 2 và LUỒNG 3
# Tham khảo: Luong-2-Dat-Lich-Le.http (Bước 3A hoặc 2B)
###############################################################################

### ✅ Staff check-in (assign battery unit)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations/{reservationId}/check-in
# Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
# Body: { "staffId": "...", "batteryUnitId": "..." }
#
# Expected: 
# - Reservation.Status = CheckedIn
# - UserSubscription.CurrentMonthSwapCount += 1 (increment counter)
# - No payment confirmation (because no payment was created)

###############################################################################
# 🚨 EDGE CASES: Error Scenarios
###############################################################################

### ❌ EC1: User không có subscription active
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}",
  "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}",
  "slotDate": "{{slotDate}}",
  "slotStartTime": "14:00:00",
  "slotEndTime": "15:00:00"
}

# Expected Response (400 Bad Request):
# {
#   "error": {
#     "code": "NO_ACTIVE_SUBSCRIPTION",
#     "message": "Bạn không có gói subscription hoạt động hoặc đã hết lượt sử dụng. Vui lòng mua gói mới hoặc thanh toán theo lần."
#   }
# }

### ❌ EC2: User đã hết lượt sử dụng trong tháng
# Setup: User's subscription has CurrentMonthSwapCount = MaxSwapsPerMonth (e.g. 10/10)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}",
  "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}",
  "slotDate": "{{slotDate}}",
  "slotStartTime": "16:00:00",
  "slotEndTime": "17:00:00"
}

# Expected Response (400 Bad Request):
# {
#   "error": {
#     "code": "NO_ACTIVE_SUBSCRIPTION",
#     "message": "Bạn không có gói subscription hoạt động hoặc đã hết lượt sử dụng..."
#   }
# }

### ❌ EC3: Subscription đã hết hạn (CurrentBillingPeriodEnd < now)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}",
  "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}",
  "slotDate": "{{slotDate}}",
  "slotStartTime": "18:00:00",
  "slotEndTime": "19:00:00"
}

# Expected Response (400 Bad Request):
# {
#   "error": {
#     "code": "NO_ACTIVE_SUBSCRIPTION",
#     "message": "Bạn không có gói subscription hoạt động..."
#   }
# }

### ❌ EC4: User đã có reservation đang active
# Same as LUỒNG 2 EC1 (ActiveReservationExistsException)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}",
  "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}",
  "slotDate": "{{slotDate}}",
  "slotStartTime": "20:00:00",
  "slotEndTime": "21:00:00"
}

# Expected Response (400 Bad Request):
# {
#   "error": {
#     "code": "ACTIVE_RESERVATION_EXISTS",
#     "message": "Bạn đã có lịch đặt đang hoạt động. Vui lòng hủy hoặc hoàn thành lịch cũ trước khi đặt mới."
#   }
# }

### ❌ EC5: Slot đã đầy
# Same as LUỒNG 2 EC2 (SlotNotAvailableException)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "{{stationId}}",
  "batteryModelId": "{{batteryModelId}}",
  "slotDate": "{{slotDate}}",
  "slotStartTime": "08:00:00",
  "slotEndTime": "09:00:00"
}

# Expected Response (400 Bad Request):
# {
#   "error": {
#     "code": "SLOT_NOT_AVAILABLE",
#     "message": "Slot này đã đầy. Vui lòng chọn slot khác."
#   }
# }

###############################################################################
# 🔍 HELPER ENDPOINTS: Data Inspection
###############################################################################

### Get user's active reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations/mine?status=0
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Get subscription usage details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/subscriptions/mine/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Get available slots (check capacity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/slot-reservations/available-slots?stationId={{stationId}}&date={{slotDate}}&batteryModelId={{batteryModelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

###############################################################################
# 📝 NOTES & TROUBLESHOOTING
###############################################################################

# ✅ Behavior Differences: LUỒNG 2 vs LUỒNG 3
# 
# | Aspect                | LUỒNG 2 (Pay-per-Swap)                      | LUỒNG 3 (Subscription)                |
# |-----------------------|----------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------|
# | **API Endpoint**      | POST /api/v1/payments/create-pay-per-swap   | POST /api/v1/slot-reservations        |
# | **Payment Required**  | ✅ Yes (VNPay or Cash)                      | ❌ No (covered by subscription)       |
# | **Payment Record**    | ✅ Creates Payment record                   | ❌ NO Payment record                  |
# | **Validation**        | Check slot availability                     | Check subscription + slot             |
# | **Response**          | PaymentUrl (VNPay) or QRCode (Cash)         | QRCode only                           |
# | **Usage Counter**     | N/A                                         | Increments at check-in                |

# ⚠️ Common Issues:
# 1. NoActiveSubscriptionException
#    - Cause: User has no subscription, subscription inactive, or limit reached
#    - Fix: Buy new subscription or use LUỒNG 2 (pay-per-swap)
#
# 2. ActiveReservationExistsException
#    - Cause: User already has Pending or CheckedIn reservation
#    - Fix: Complete or cancel existing reservation first
#
# 3. CurrentMonthSwapCount not incrementing
#    - Expected: Counter increments during CHECK-IN, not during booking
#    - Verify: Check SwapTransactions table after check-in

# 🔐 Security Notes:
# - Endpoint requires [Authorize] - JWT token mandatory
# - User can only book for themselves (userId extracted from JWT)
# - Subscription validation prevents abuse (limit enforcement)

# 🎯 Frontend Integration Checklist:
# 1. ✅ Call GET /subscriptions/mine to check if user has active subscription
# 2. ✅ If subscription exists: Use LUỒNG 3 (POST /slot-reservations) - no payment UI
# 3. ✅ If no subscription: Show payment options → Use LUỒNG 2 (pay-per-swap)
# 4. ✅ Display QR code from response
# 5. ✅ Handle error codes: NO_ACTIVE_SUBSCRIPTION, ACTIVE_RESERVATION_EXISTS, SLOT_NOT_AVAILABLE
# 6. ✅ Show swap usage (e.g. "3/10 lượt đã dùng") using GET /subscriptions/mine/usage

